      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Local account \u2014 always available",
      "items": [
        "One admin created on first boot, never rewritten",
        "Password generated and printed once, or set by env",
        "PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA512 with a per-hash salt"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "OIDC \u2014 optional, vendor-neutral",
      "items": [
        "Any issuer; endpoints come from its discovery doc",
        "Provider process is :firstmate_oidc, not a vendor",
        "ALLOWED_EMAIL_DOMAIN is opt-in, unset by default"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Fail-soft \u2014 the node survives",
      "items": [
        "ueberauth_oidcc :issuers stays empty on purpose",
